      "title": "Eliminating the ambiguity in the cyclotomic norm",
      "chapter": "inputs",
      "anchor": "inputs-dual-system-normalize",
      "statement": "For x_d=Pδ,a(X_d)^(2N₀d), the exact norm N_q(x_qd)=(x_d/φ⁻¹x_d)^S and the residue comparison x_qd≡(φ⁻¹x_d)^S hold with S=q·s(d,q) prime to ℓ.",
